          human: "Welcome to Hockey, the Canadian card game that brings ice hockey to your table. Play three periods, each using the full 52-card deck. Create a 'breakaway' by playing a card matching the top pile card or any Jack. Then, if your opponent's next play matches your card, you score a goal! Most goals after three periods wins the match. Shout 'Breakaway!' and 'Goal!' for thematic fun.",
          ai: 'Game: Hockey (Canadian fishing game, 1961). 2-player, 52-card deck. Periods: 3 (plus sudden death if tied). Deal: 5 cards per player per deal, 6 in final deal of period. Turn: Play card to pile. Breakaway: Match top card rank OR play Jack. Goal: Opponent matches your card after your breakaway = 1 goal. Scoring: Most goals after 3 periods wins match.',
